   "body": "**PO decision, 2026-11-09**: the build starts now, without waiting for the visuals of #632.\n- Inputs are merged on `dev-swift`: `questions.md` (#667), `donnees.md` (#669), `formulaire-spec.md` (#668), `cadrage-construction.md` (#670). Tailscale Funnel is the retained exposure (#706, follow-up of the spec).\n- Visuals: use clearly marked placeholders at the paths and sizes of `cadrage-construction.md` §3.3; the files of #632 drop in later without code changes.\n- #632 stays a dependency for the launch (#635), not for the build.\n\n---\n_Posted with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) for the PO (Bruno)._\n",
